{"id": "caltrain-train-control-contract-replacement", "title": "Caltrain replaced its train-control contractor after years of delay", "seconds": 46.8, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "72dbf0ed264d4e1a", "words": 127, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Caltrain needed a safety system for its commuter trains.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 2.94, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Why", "replace", "the", "train", "control", "contractor?"], "sub": "Caltrain"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.54, 0.8, 0.9, 1.26, 1.61, 1.76, 1.9, 2.28]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The advisory minutes show two different Parsons proposal amounts.", "t0": 3.06, "t1": 6.17, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "2011 proposals", "heading": "Before the fiber option", "source": "choices", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Original Parsons proposal", "value": "$160 million"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "Final proposal", "value": "$124 million"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.69, 1.01, 1.25, 1.48, 1.82, 2.23, 2.7]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Caltrain terminated the contract in 2017, citing repeated delays and inadequate progress.", "t0": 6.29, "t1": 11.83, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "term", "kicker": "Peninsula Corridor Joint Powers Board / Caltrain", "text": "February 2017 termination", "mark": "February 2017 termination"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.52, 1.02, 1.14, 1.67, 1.78, 2.08, 3.08, 3.5, 3.89, 4.36, 4.5, 4.97]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Parsons challenged that termination in court.", "t0": 11.95, "t1": 13.93, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Disputed termination"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.43, 0.8, 0.96, 1.57, 1.69]}, {"scene": "replacement", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "In March 2018 Caltrain awarded Wabtec the replacement contract.", "t0": 14.15, "t1": 18.04, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "award", "kicker": "Peninsula Corridor Joint Powers Board / Caltrain", "text": "March 1, 2018", "mark": "March 1, 2018"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.46, 0.77, 1.27, 1.77, 2.18, 2.7, 2.83, 3.35]}, {"scene": "replacement", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Advisory minutes put the replacement contract budget at 49.5 million dollars.", "t0": 18.16, "t1": 22.84, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$49.5 million", "label": "Wabtec contract budget"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.63, 0.93, 1.11, 1.24, 1.75, 2.23, 2.56, 2.69, 3.22, 3.51, 3.86, 4.21]}, {"scene": "replacement", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The engineering presentation identified work from the earlier contract that could be reused.", "t0": 22.96, "t1": 27.49, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "reuse", "kicker": "Peninsula Corridor Joint Powers Board / Caltrain", "text": "Reused equipment", "mark": "Reused equipment"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.66, 1.36, 2.01, 2.26, 2.41, 2.56, 2.93, 3.47, 3.62, 3.79, 3.93]}, {"scene": "replacement", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Caltrain later reported federal certification of its safety system.", "t0": 27.61, "t1": 30.99, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "cert", "kicker": "Peninsula Corridor Joint Powers Board / Caltrain", "text": "Safety certification", "mark": "Safety certification"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.59, 0.85, 1.29, 1.61, 2.33, 2.46, 2.59, 2.93]}, {"scene": "replacement", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "In 2021 Caltrain and Parsons agreed to dismiss claims without paying one another.", "t0": 31.11, "t1": 35.76, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "settle", "kicker": "Peninsula Corridor Joint Powers Board / Caltrain", "text": "September 2021", "mark": "September 2021"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.48, 1.1, 1.64, 1.75, 2.22, 2.56, 2.66, 3.09, 3.48, 3.83, 4.17, 4.31]}, {"scene": "replacement", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "A separate judgment involving Parsons and its subcontractor was appealed.", "t0": 35.88, "t1": 39.53, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "subcontractor dispute"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.59, 1.01, 1.46, 1.89, 2.03, 2.16, 3.0, 3.17]}, {"scene": "replacement", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The replacement budget alone cannot measure what the earlier work ultimately cost.", "t0": 39.65, "t1": 43.68, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Net cost of replacement", "Final outcome"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.67, 1.01, 1.36, 1.77, 2.09, 2.26, 2.42, 2.81, 3.09, 3.57]}, {"scene": "replacement", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 43.8, "t1": 45.91, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.63, 0.79, 1.03, 1.11, 1.21, 1.47, 1.75]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The first contract", "replacement": "The replacement contract"}, "look": "flow", "hook": "timeline"}